# Generated and build output. Without these, `COPY . .` carries a developer's
# stale artifacts into the builder — tsc does not clean its outDir, so anything
# the current schema no longer generates would survive into the image — and
# uploads hundreds of MB of Worker build output to the daemon on every build.
packages/db/src
packages/db/dist
apps/web/.open-next
apps/web/.wrangler
apps/web/.dev.vars
# An interrupted Worker build leaves the real dotenv files under these names.
*.build-stash
